		{
			"id": "sDG9wlv2sQK0agIgU",
			"name": "Stealth",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Ravener's ambush depends on approaching unseen beneath the ground until the moment it erupts.\n\nDesign: DX+1 (15) for 4 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
